{"1361400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonglow Bay", "steam_appid": 1361400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/f71f0c2e07dedd585ede26c3060d38ec.poster.avif?t=1741171471\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/f71f0c2e07dedd585ede26c3060d38ec.webm?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/f71f0c2e07dedd585ede26c3060d38ec.mp4?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Dive into an emotionally charged story set in the serene backdrop of Moonglow Bay, in this relaxing, slice-of-life fishing RPG!<br><br>Take on the role of a rookie angler, driven by the final wish of your beloved partner, as you navigate through the challenges of a town on the brink of bankruptcy. Equipped with only your journal and trusty rod, embark on a journey to uncover the secrets hidden beneath the waves of Moonglow Bay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an Aquatic Adventure </strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Discover the Depths</strong>: Cast nets, set traps, line, and ice fish to discover over 151 aquatic species lurking beneath the surface.<br></li><li><strong>Preserve and Present</strong>: Cook your catch of the day or proudly show them off at the local aquarium.<br></li><li><strong>Explore Enigmatic Locales</strong>: Traverse the Glacier and Sulphur zones, unravel the mysteries of the Astral Clouds, and prepare for encounters with the Mythical Monsters of Moonglow.<br></li><li><strong>Share the Adventure</strong>: Team up with friends in local co-op and embark on a heartwarming journey together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/b31a5f7042ce56550d5ba9959781b9c3.poster.avif?t=1741171471\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/b31a5f7042ce56550d5ba9959781b9c3.webm?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/b31a5f7042ce56550d5ba9959781b9c3.mp4?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revitalise the Bay</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Celebrate the Centennial</strong>: Help revitalise the once-thriving fishing town, breathing new life into its weathered buildings.<br></li><li><strong>Meet the Townsfolk</strong>: Befriend the locals and accept quests through the bulletin board to restore the Bay’s fractured community.<br></li><li><strong>Equip for Success</strong>: Stock up on bait, tackle, and ship upgrades to prepare for the challenges ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/d0bc7431938c12d0ce881855b431a75f.poster.avif?t=1741171471\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/d0bc7431938c12d0ce881855b431a75f.webm?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/d0bc7431938c12d0ce881855b431a75f.mp4?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Heart of Moonglow</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Vivid Voxel Art</strong>: Immerse yourself in Moonglow Bay's stunning visual style complimenting your adventure every step of the way.<br></li><li><strong>Sumptuous Soundtrack</strong>: Lose yourself in Lena Raine's enchanting score that seamlessly flows with the rhythm of your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/0b0f85a9894f1fda24039d60173d85d7.poster.avif?t=1741171471\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/0b0f85a9894f1fda24039d60173d85d7.webm?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/0b0f85a9894f1fda24039d60173d85d7.mp4?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Picture Perfect Update</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Photomode Delight</strong>: Capture the beauty of Moonglow Bay from every angle with our new photomode feature.<br></li><li><strong>Customise Your Haven</strong>: Personalise your storefront with new decorations that reflect your unique style and personality.<br></li><li><strong>Unearth Ancient Mysteries</strong>: Join Marina on a thrilling quest to uncover the skeleton of a long-lost sea creature. Piece together its bones, decode its legend, and embark on a journey that spans land and sea in search of elusive fossils.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/f71f0c2e07dedd585ede26c3060d38ec.poster.avif?t=1741171471\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/f71f0c2e07dedd585ede26c3060d38ec.webm?t=1741171471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1361400/extras/f71f0c2e07dedd585ede26c3060d38ec.mp4?t